# FireBase Data Structure

users/
  {uid}/
    displayName
    email
    role
    createdAt

tasks/
  {taskId}/
    userId
    title
    category
    dueDate
    priority
    completed
    createdAt

bookings/
  {bookingId}/
    userId
    topic
    preferredDate
    notes
    status

scores/
  {scoreId}/
    userId
    score
    duration
    completedAt

# REST API Planning

(https://learner-support-portal-4ccc1-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com) 

## Users Endpoints

| Action           | HTTP Method | Endpoint            |
| ---------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |
| Create user data | POST        | `/users.json`       |
| Get all users    | GET         | `/users.json`       |
| Get one user     | GET         | `/users/{uid}.json` |
| Update user      | PATCH       | `/users/{uid}.json` |
| Delete user data | DELETE      | `/users/{uid}.json` |

