# CRUD Planning

| CRUD Operation | Firebase Method | Purpose              |
| -------------- | --------------- | -------------------- |
| **Create**     | POST            | Add new data         |
| **Read**       | GET             | Retrieve data        |
| **Update**     | PATCH           | Change existing data |
| **Delete**     | DELETE          | Remove data          |
